    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627640/extras/5179c57aed27f6c9b93289c38b567aea.avif?t=1752089029\" width=706 height=232 /></span><br><br>The gate to the Underworld is open, and the realm's heroes have fallen to the hordes of undead. All hope remains in the hands of a little goblin tinker. <br><br><strong>Tower Defense Dungeon Crawling Action</strong><br><br>Descend 16 devilishly hand-crafted, monster-filled levels to close the gate to the Underworld in this top-down tower defense dungeon crawler. Gather resources, discover new tower blueprints, and build defensive towers to slice, dice, zap, and explode undead hordes. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627640/extras/eae52087119498176a5af590531d086f.poster.avif?t=1752089029\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627640/extras/eae52087119498176a5af590531d086f.webm?t=1752089029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627640/extras/eae52087119498176a5af590531d086f.mp4?t=1752089029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Local Co-op Mode</strong><br><br>Play solo or 2-4 player local co-op!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627640/extras/6ba04216bd94d7811e0f91da12d29c2c.poster.avif?t=1752089029\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627640/extras/6ba04216bd94d7811e0f91da12d29c2c.webm?t=1752089029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627640/extras/6ba04216bd94d7811e0f91da12d29c2c.mp4?t=1752089029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Infinite Replayability</strong><br><br>If you yearn for more undead-slaying action, enter the procedurally-generated dungeon arenas for infinite replayability!",
